{"articleNo":"99227","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=99227&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[☆졸업☆]2013학년도 전기 졸업사정내역 제공(졸업가능여부 확인시스템)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.01.24","hit":"5968","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"view_content\" id=\"view_content\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">2013학년도 전기(2014년 2월) 졸업사정내역</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">을 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">\"</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #353535; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">졸업가능여부 확인메뉴를 이용\"</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">아래와 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">제공</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">함을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #22741c\" color=\"#ffffff\">* 현재 졸업사정자료 확인 중으로, 졸업사정내역은 변경될 수 있음을 알려드립니다.</font></span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" st